    "body": "### What are you trying to do\n\nAdd a new dialog so we can:\n- temp change the machine (overriding the value set in the project)\n- change the program name and description\n- change/remember the output folder\n- override the units of measure (inches/mm)\n- add chip conveyor info (idle time, run time, use chip transport)\n- specify the rotary table axis (none, x, y, z, x reversed, y reversed, z reversed)\n- override/specify preferences (dwell in seconds, force work offset, measure tools at start, optional stop, optional stop between operations, use coolant, use M6, radius arcs, smoothing level, washdown coolant\n- safe retracts (G28, G30, clearance height)\n- formats (use sequence numbers: yes, no, only on tool change, only on operation start), start sequence number, separate words with spaces, write machine, write tool list, write version\n- coolant: multi air coolant blast, mutl-coolant equipped, SmartCool equipped, SmartCool sweep percentage\n- tapping: self reversing head feed ratio, tapping retract speed, tapping style (Rigid G33.1, Standard G84, self reversing head)\n- built-in values: allow helical moves, high feedrate mapping, max circular radius, min chord length, circular radius, tolerance\n\n### How you imagine it working\n\n- Replace the simple \"name/folder\" dialog with more information specified above.\n- These values and options will have to be added and tests added.\n- This may be too large for a single issue. Not sure if we should try to split some of it into other issues.",
